=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play firewall/debian13 ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Firewall screen proposed for slice 4,$
# drawn from what real code reads of a simulated host$
# (firewall.Incoming.Check, ufw.Read, pve.ReadFirewall,$
# sshd.ReadEffective, reload.ReadBound), Enable the real$
# steps.PlanUFWEnable on the real plan/apply engine. Install,$
# Disable, the runlevel and the profiles' plans are the$
# gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this$
# machine changes: every command and file is the fake's, and its$
# record is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: firewall/debian13$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. ufw is not installed$
# (check-firewall.md §3: Debian installs it only on request,$
# [unverified]).$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured ufw not installed$
$
# ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Installed            No$
$
# SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  [::]:22              Not filtered$
   -  0.0.0.0:22           Not filtered$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Install UFW          Install the ufw package$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Install UFW ##################################################$
$
# ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Package              ufw$
   -  Status               Inactive$
$
   -  Install ufw$
      ufw$
      -not installed$
      +installed, inactive$
      $ apt-get install -y ufw$
$
  Install ufw? [y/N, 0 or q]: y$
$
  [+] Install ufw          Done$
$
# Operation Successful$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured inactive$
$
# ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [ ] Status               Inactive$
  [+] Incoming policy      Deny$
  [ ] At boot              No$
$
# SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  [::]:22              Not filtered$
   -  0.0.0.0:22           Not filtered$
$
# Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  No firewall rules configured$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable firewall      Let SSH through, deny the rest$
                           [ ] Lockout risk$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Info: firewall/debian13$
# Recorded by the fake, not done: what each step ran on web-$
# 01.example.net, and the files it changed, in order; hardn's$
# own journal, run directory and backups left out.$
$
   -  Applied: Install ufw$
      $ apt-get install -y ufw$
$

